      "sourceHash": "c0c9fa2b9cd16ea112c664b19bc3ce880a0362539fee820e596d3b1395228704",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 4.86,
          "en": "Okay, so now that we have a first idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.86,
          "end": 7.41,
          "en": "of how the theming system generally works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.41,
          "end": 10.29,
          "en": "and how we might wanna adjust the theme,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.29,
          "end": 14.31,
          "en": "the question of course is how should we now adjust the theme",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.31,
          "end": 16.443,
          "en": "and which parameters should you set here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.28,
          "end": 19.98,
          "en": "Well, in general, as always, it is a good idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.98,
          "end": 23.55,
          "en": "to simply play around with different parameters here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.55,
          "end": 25.47,
          "en": "but there is at least one thing you should know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.47,
          "end": 28.59,
          "en": "before you start playing around with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.59,
          "end": 30.66,
          "en": "When it comes to setting up colors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.66,
          "end": 34.26,
          "en": "there are many different parameters you can target here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.26,
          "end": 37.83,
          "en": "and you have to understand that this copyWith method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.83,
          "end": 40.2,
          "en": "allows you to set up some base colors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.2,
          "end": 43.56,
          "en": "like accentColor, or primaryColor,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.56,
          "end": 46.83,
          "en": "which will then be used by multiple widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.83,
          "end": 48.33,
          "en": "that are built into Flutter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.33,
          "end": 51.93,
          "en": "And you can also use these colors in your own widgets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.93,
          "end": 54.09,
          "en": "as I will show you later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.09,
          "end": 56.88,
          "en": "But besides setting some general colors like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.88,
          "end": 58.98,
          "en": "you can also set individual colors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.98,
          "end": 61.47,
          "en": "like the scaffoldBackgroundColor,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.47,
          "end": 65.34,
          "en": "or you can set up entire sub themes, you could say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.34,
          "end": 67.38,
          "en": "like the elevatedButtonTheme,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.38,
          "end": 70.56,
          "en": "which requires a separate ThemeData object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.56,
          "end": 74.73,
          "en": "which then allows you to set up some button specific styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.73,
          "end": 76.77,
          "en": "And this can of course all be overwhelming,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.77,
          "end": 79.95,
          "en": "which is why we will set up these things step by step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.95,
          "end": 81.87,
          "en": "But when it comes to setting up colors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.87,
          "end": 84.72,
          "en": "there is a certain approach which I recommend using,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.72,
          "end": 86.67,
          "en": "and that is the usage of a colorScheme.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.99,
          "end": 89.76,
          "en": "And that's what I meant before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.76,
          "end": 91.83,
          "en": "the theming system in Flutter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.83,
          "end": 94.74000000000001,
          "en": "saw a lot of changes over the years.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.74000000000001,
          "end": 98.00999999999999,
          "en": "And colorScheme is now not a new approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.00999999999999,
          "end": 101.37,
          "en": "but arguably the easiest approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.37,
          "end": 104.16,
          "en": "of applying some colors to many widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.16,
          "end": 105.75,
          "en": "without having to manually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.75,
          "end": 108.63,
          "en": "set a bunch of colors individually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108.63,
          "end": 110.19,
          "en": "Instead with colorScheme,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 110.19,
          "end": 112.92,
          "en": "the idea is that you define one color scheme",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 112.92,
          "end": 116.13,
          "en": "and Flutter then infers colors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.13,
          "end": 118.74000000000001,
          "en": "different shades of colors to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.74000000000001,
          "end": 120.153,
          "en": "for different widgets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.08,
          "end": 123.99,
          "en": "And for that, I'll first of all create such a color scheme,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 123.99,
          "end": 125.31,
          "en": "and I'll do that outside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.31,
          "end": 128.01,
          "en": "of this ThemeData constructor function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 128.01,
          "end": 131.553,
          "en": "to keep my code a bit more organized and structured.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.48,
          "end": 134.37,
          "en": "So here I'll create a new variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 134.37,
          "end": 135.963,
          "en": "and I'll name it KColorScheme.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 137.7,
          "end": 140.64,
          "en": "And starting with K is just a convention",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 140.64,
          "end": 143.73,
          "en": "you might wanna use in Flutter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 143.73,
          "end": 145.8,
          "en": "that you set up global variables",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 145.8,
          "end": 147.78,
          "en": "with the starting character K.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 147.78,
          "end": 149.25,
          "en": "It's not something you have to do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 149.25,
          "end": 151.2,
          "en": "but it is something you'll see quite a lot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 151.2,
          "end": 155.13,
          "en": "especially for theme-related variables in other projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 155.13,
          "end": 157.77,
          "en": "So that's why I'll use it here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 157.77,
          "end": 160.62,
          "en": "And the idea here simply is that this variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 160.62,
          "end": 163.62,
          "en": "now contains a color scheme which we can use down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 163.62,
          "end": 165.66,
          "en": "for setting up our theme.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 165.66,
          "end": 167.97,
          "en": "And a color scheme can be created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 167.97,
          "end": 171.54,
          "en": "by using Flutter's ColorScheme class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 171.54,
          "end": 174.18,
          "en": "And whilst you could also create that from scratch,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 174.18,
          "end": 176.4,
          "en": "which again would require you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 176.4,
          "end": 178.62,
          "en": "to set a lot of colors manually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 178.62,
          "end": 182.73,
          "en": "ColorScheme also gives you a fromSeed method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 182.73,
          "end": 186.57,
          "en": "or a fromSeed constructor function, which I recommend using,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 186.57,
          "end": 189.12,
          "en": "because that is actually the constructor function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 189.12,
          "end": 192.3,
          "en": "that will then automatically create a color scheme",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 192.3,
          "end": 196.38,
          "en": "with different shades of colors based on one base color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 196.38,
          "end": 197.88,
          "en": "one seedColor that you set up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 200.07,
          "end": 205.053,
          "en": "And here I'll create a color manually with Color.fromARGB.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 206.04,
          "end": 208.71,
          "en": "And here I picked a color in advance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 208.71,
          "end": 213.6,
          "en": "where my alpha channel has a value of 255,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 213.6,
          "end": 218.4,
          "en": "red has 96, the green channel has 59,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 218.4,
          "end": 221.013,
          "en": "and blue has a value of 181.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 222.36,
          "end": 226.293,
          "en": "And this is a constant value, so we can add const here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 227.46,
          "end": 230.16,
          "en": "And with that ColorScheme defined here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 230.16,
          "end": 233.793,
          "en": "we can use that as a value down there in our theme.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 235.02,
          "end": 239.91,
          "en": "And if we do that, and again, we enforce those changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 239.91,
          "end": 243.36,
          "en": "now you don't see a lot of changes here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 243.36,
          "end": 246.18,
          "en": "but you see them, if I for example, open that modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 246.18,
          "end": 250.08,
          "en": "Here, you see the buttons now have this purple color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 250.08,
          "end": 254.493,
          "en": "And the background also has a light purple shade at least.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 255.54,
          "end": 257.28,
          "en": "Same is true for these cards here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 257.28,
          "end": 259.47,
          "en": "which have a light purple background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 259.47,
          "end": 262.02,
          "en": "And of course, we're also not done yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 262.02,
          "end": 264.72,
          "en": "because now with that ColorScheme set up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 264.72,
          "end": 267.06,
          "en": "you can fine-tune your theme.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 267.06,
          "end": 269.49,
          "en": "Besides setting up the ColorScheme",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 269.49,
          "end": 270.87,
          "en": "when setting up the theme,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 270.87,
          "end": 274.77,
          "en": "you can now also overwrite selected parts of the theme",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 274.77,
          "end": 277.29,
          "en": "based on your ColorScheme though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 277.29,
          "end": 280.8,
          "en": "For example, you can set up an appBarTheme here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 280.8,
          "end": 284.52,
          "en": "and create an appBarTheme object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 284.52,
          "end": 287.52,
          "en": "Again, best done by creating an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 287.52,
          "end": 288.93,
          "en": "and then using copyWith,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 288.93,
          "end": 292.86,
          "en": "so that you get some default AppBarTheme settings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 292.86,
          "end": 297.48,
          "en": "by Flutter, and you then just override selected settings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 297.48,
          "end": 299.19,
          "en": "And here you can then, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 299.19,
          "end": 303.09,
          "en": "override the background color of the app bar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 303.09,
          "end": 306.51,
          "en": "and set this to a color from your ColorScheme.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 306.51,
          "end": 308.97,
          "en": "So reference your ColorScheme here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 308.97,
          "end": 312.51,
          "en": "but now you get different properties on that scheme object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 312.51,
          "end": 315.84,
          "en": "that were inferred and set automatically by Flutter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 315.84,
          "end": 318.33,
          "en": "based on your seed color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 318.33,
          "end": 322.2,
          "en": "For example, here, I'll choose onPrimaryContainer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 322.2,
          "end": 325.68,
          "en": "as a background color for my app bar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 325.68,
          "end": 329.58,
          "en": "And I can only encourage you to try out different colors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 329.58,
          "end": 332.49,
          "en": "that were inferred here to see the difference.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 332.49,
          "end": 335.94,
          "en": "But I'll go for onPrimaryContainer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 335.94,
          "end": 339.6,
          "en": "And I'll also set a foreground color for my AppBarTheme",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 339.6,
          "end": 342.48,
          "en": "and also set that based on my ColorScheme.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 342.48,
          "end": 344.913,
          "en": "And here I'll choose the primaryContainer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 345.75,
          "end": 349.83,
          "en": "so that I pick these two colors from my ColorScheme",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 349.83,
          "end": 352.14,
          "en": "that is based on this seed color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 352.14,
          "end": 354.453,
          "en": "to fine-tune my appBarTheme.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 355.35,
          "end": 357.33,
          "en": "And there are more things you could set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 357.33,
          "end": 358.86,
          "en": "on that appBarTheme,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 358.86,
          "end": 361.74,
          "en": "for example, that the title should always be centered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 361.74,
          "end": 365.58,
          "en": "or that there should be some drop shadow behind it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 365.58,
          "end": 367.44,
          "en": "These are all things you can set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 367.44,
          "end": 371.34,
          "en": "and again, definitely play around with these settings,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 371.34,
          "end": 373.11,
          "en": "but since we're using copyWith,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 373.11,
          "end": 375.69,
          "en": "we don't have to set these settings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 375.69,
          "end": 377.49,
          "en": "Instead we're using the default settings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 377.49,
          "end": 379.418,
          "en": "and we're just overriding backgroundColor",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 379.418,
          "end": 380.251,
          "en": "and foregroundColor.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 381.33,
          "end": 383.853,
          "en": "And here we can then actually also use const.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 385.02,
          "end": 387.72,
          "en": "And with that, if we now save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 387.72,
          "end": 390,
          "en": "you see that I have a totally different look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 390,
          "end": 392.28,
          "en": "for my app bar here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 392.28,
          "end": 395.1,
          "en": "because of these selective overrides",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 395.1,
